<span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="#0a7a52" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>kod zostaje Wasz</span>
